{"parentUuid":"36fd2cef-4dc8-4832-9100-6bacd485cb22","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"b3340351-6fa9-464b-9a18-f32c9f337aa6","agentId":"a609de5288d839c25","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QqY3PHepuoE1sEhrLUB3BP","type":"tool_result","content":"<div class=\"bench-resume\">\r\n    <div class=\"bench-resume-row\">\r\n      <span>last scan 5 h ago</span>\r\n      \r\n      <span class=\"bench-resume-progress\">&middot; 0 of 22 done</span>\r\n    </div>\r\n    \r\n    \r\n      <p class=\"bench-resume-next\">Cannot verify yet: the EVAP monitor will not run above 85 % fuel (set at 93.73 %). Burn fuel into the 15-85 % window, then complete a drive cycle. Meanwhile: Inspect the recirculation-line quick-connect (S2125000002).</p>\r\n    \r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n  \r\n    <p class=\"bench-next-action\">Cannot verify yet: the EVAP monitor will not run above 85 % fuel (set at 93.73 %). Burn fuel into the 15-85 % window, then complete a drive cycle. Meanwhile: Inspect the recirculation-line quick-connect (S2125000002).</p>\r\n  \r\n\r\n  \r\n    <details class=\"bench-why\">\r\n      <summary>Why unverified repair?</summary>\r\n      <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin:4px 0 0\">last clear 2026-09-29 10:46:00 (SCAN_2609291046.txt); no code has returned</p>\r\n      \r\n        <ul class=\"small muted\">\r\n          <li>no readiness read from the car since the clear</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n      \r\n    </details>\r\n  \r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n  \r\n  <div class=\"bench-gates\">\r\n    <div class=\"bench-gate out\">\r\n      <h4>Fuel gate (EVAP needs 15&ndash;85%)</h4>\r\n      \r\n        <p style=\"margin:0\">93.73%\r\n           &mdash; above window</p>\r\n        \r\n          <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin:0\">litres to burn: UNKNOWN (no sourced tank capacity)</p>\r\n        \r\n      \r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"bench-gate\">\r\n      <h4>Readiness</h4>\r\n      \r\n        <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin:0\">no readiness read yet</p>\r\n      \r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n----GATES----\r\n<div class=\"bench-gates\">\r\n    <div class=\"bench-gate out\">\r\n      <h4>Fuel gate (EVAP needs 15&ndash;85%)</h4>\r\n      \r\n        <p style=\"margin:0\">93.73%\r\n           &mdash; above window</p>\r\n        \r\n          <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin:0\">litres to burn: UNKNOWN (no sourced tank capacity)</p>\r\n        \r\n      \r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"bench-gate\">\r\n      <h4>Readiness</h4>\r\n      \r\n        <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin:0\">no readiness read yet</p>\r\n      \r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  \r\n  \r\n    <div class=\"bench-job-shared\">\r\n      \r\n        <div class=\"bench-parts muted\">\r\n          <b>Parts for this job:</b>\r\n          \r\n            <span class=\"bench-part\">Evaporative System Integrity Module (ESIM, leak-detection pump) &middot;\r\n              <span class=\"mono\">04861961AD</span></span>\r\n          \r\n            <span class=\"bench-part\">EVAP purge valve / solenoid &middot;\r\n              <span class=\"mono\">68337662AC</span></span>\r\n          \r\n            <span class=\"bench-part\">EVAP (fuel vapor) canister &middot;\r\n              <span class=\"mono\">68400620A_ / 68402531A_ / 68528496A_ / 68534104A_</span></span>\r\n          \r\n        </div>\r\n      \r\n      \r\n        <div class=\"bench-tools\">\r\n          <b>Tools for this job:</b>\r\n          \r\n            <span class=\"chip plain bench-tool \">\r\n              EVAP smoke machine &mdash;\r\n              unknown: ask\r\n            </span>\r\n          \r\n            <span class=\"chip plain bench-tool \">\r\n              Fuel-line quick-connect release tool set &mdash;\r\n              unknown: ask\r\n            </span>\r\n          \r\n            <span class=\"chip plain bench-tool \">\r\n              Hand-held vacuum pump (Mityvac-style, w/ gauge) &mdash;\r\n              unknown: ask\r\n            </span>\r\n          \r\n            <span class=\"chip plain bench-tool \">\r\n              Laptop running MultiEcuScan (MES) &mdash;\r\n              unknown: ask\r\n            </span>\r\n          \r\n        </div>\r\n      \r\n    </div>\r\n  \r\n\r\n  <div class=\"bench-actions\">\r\n    \r\n      <div class=\"bench-card\" id=\"task-evap-1\" data-task-id=\"evap-1\" data-state=\"ready\">\r\n        <form method=\"post\" action=\"/v/ZASFAKPN5J7B88115/bench/done\" class=\"bench-check\">\r\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"step_id\" value=\"evap-1\">\r\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"chk-evap-1\" name=\"done\" value=\"1\"\r\n                 class=\"bench-checkbox-real\" \r\n                 aria-label=\"Mark done: Inspect the recirculation-line quick-connect\"\r\n                 form=\"form-evap-1\">\r\n          <label for=\"chk-evap-1\" class=\"bench-check-label\">Mark done</label>\r\n        </form>\r\n        <div class=\"bench-card-body\">\r\n          <details>\r\n            <summary class=\"bench-card-text\">\r\n              <span class=\"ico ico-20\"><svg role=\"img\" aria-label=\"EVAP\"><use href=\"/static/icons.svg?v=3d2dcbe0c9#i-sys_evap\"></use></svg></span>\r\n              <span>Inspect the recirculation-line quick-connect</span>\r\n              <span class=\"chip plain bench-state-badge state-ready\">READY</span>\r\n            </summary>\r\n            <div class=\"bench-card-detail\">\r\n              \r\n              <p style=\"margin:0\"><b>Procedure:</b>\r\n                Check the recirculation-line mid-point quick-connect for a loose connection.</p>\r\n              \r\n                <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin:0\">Tool: Hands. Two minutes.</p>\r\n              \r\n              <p class=\"bench-pass-line\" style=\"margin:0\">Pass = Connector fully seated and latched.</p>\r\n              \r\n                <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin:0\">If abnormal: Reseat it; this is FCA&#39;s documented first check for exactly these codes. Re-verify (below) before doing anything else.</p>\r\n              \r\n              \r\n                <p class=\"small\" style=\"margin:0\">Doc:\r\n                  <a href=\"#tsb-S2125000002\">S2125000002</a>\r\n                   &mdash; EVAP leak codes -- check the recirculation-line quick-connect first</p>\r\n              \r\n              \r\n                <ul class=\"bench-inspect-steps small muted\">\r\n                  \r\n                    <li>purge_valve_connector: hose routing and connector seating at the ejector tees (visual + wiggle test) &mdash; TSB 9100325 Rev 1</li>\r\n                  \r\n                    <li>esim_connector: connector corrosion/seating; housing wet with fuel (visual) &mdash; TSB 9100471</li>\r\n                  \r\n                    <li>esim_ground: ground integrity (voltage-drop test) &mdash; none -- TechAuthority</li>\r\n                  \r\n                </ul>\r\n              \r\n\r\n              <form method=\"post\" action=\"/v/ZASFAKPN5J7B88115/bench/done\" id=\"form-evap-1\" class=\"bench-outcome-fields\">\r\n                <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"step_id\" value=\"evap-1\">\r\n                <select name=\"outcome\">\r\n                  <option value=\"ok\" >OK</option>\r\n                  <option value=\"fault_found\" >Fault found</option>\r\n                  <option value=\"skipped\" >Skipped</option>\r\n                </select>\r\n                <input type=\"text\" name=\"note\" placeholder=\"finding / reason\" value=\"\">\r\n                <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn\">Save</button>\r\n              </form>\r\n              \r\n            </div>\r\n          </details>\r\n          \r\n            <span class=\"chip plain bench-bulletin\">S2125000002</span>\r\n          \r\n          \r\n          \r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    \r\n      <div class=\"bench-card\" id=\"task-evap-2\" data-task-id=\"evap-2\" data-state=\"blocked\">\r\n        <form method=\"post\" action=\"/v/ZASFAKPN5J7B88115/bench/done\" class=\"bench-check\">\r\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"step_id\" value=\"evap-2\">\r\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"chk-evap-2\" name=\"done\" value=\"1\"\r\n                 class=\"bench-checkbox-real\" \r\n                 aria-label=\"Mark done: Run the purge/vent valve KOEO actuator test\"\r\n                 form=\"form-evap-2\">\r\n          <label for=\"chk-evap-2\" class=\"bench-check-label\">Mark done</label>\r\n        </form>\r\n        <div class=\"bench-card-body\">\r\n          <details>\r\n            <summary class=\"bench-card-text\">\r\n              <span class=\"ico ico-20\"><svg role=\"img\" aria-label=\"EVAP\"><use href=\"/static/icons.svg?v=3d2dcbe0c9#i-sys_evap\"></use></svg></span>\r\n              <span>Run the purge/vent valve KOEO actuator test</span>\r\n              <span class=\"chip plain bench-state-badge state-blocked\">BLOCKED: MES running</span>\r\n            </summary>\r\n            <div class=\"bench-card-detail\">\r\n              \r\n                <div class=\"bench-preconditions\">\r\n                  \r\n                    <span class=\"chip plain bench-precondition not-ok\">\r\n                      MES running: blocked\r\n                       &mdash; <a href=\"/live\">Open Live</a>\r\n                      \r\n                    </span>\r\n                  \r\n                </div>\r\n              \r\n              <p style=\"margin:0\"><b>Procedure:</b>\r\n                Key on, ENGINE OFF. In MES (IAW 10JA, Actuators tab) run &#39;Evaporation control valve&#39;; listen/feel for the click and watch the commanded parameter respond.</p>\r\n              \r\n                <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin:0\">Tool: MES actuator test; afterwards actuator_history logs the run.</p>\r\n              \r\n              <p class=\"bench-pass-line\" style=\"margin:0\">Pass = Audible/tactile click, COMPLETED result, parameter follows command.</p>\r\n              \r\n                <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin:0\">If abnormal: No click or FAILED with the engine off = valve or wiring fault on that branch; diagnose that circuit before any leak-hunting.</p>\r\n              \r\n              \r\n              \r\n                <ul class=\"bench-inspect-steps small muted\">\r\n                  \r\n                    <li>purge_valve_connector: hose routing and connector seating at the ejector tees (visual + wiggle test) &mdash; TSB 9100325 Rev 1</li>\r\n                  \r\n                    <li>esim_connector: connector corrosion/seating; housing wet with fuel (visual) &mdash; TSB 9100471</li>\r\n                  \r\n                    <li>esim_ground: ground integrity (voltage-drop test) &mdash; none -- TechAuthority</li>\r\n                  \r\n                </ul>\r\n              \r\n\r\n              <form method=\"post\" action=\"/v/ZASFAKPN5J7B88115/bench/done\" id=\"form-evap-2\" class=\"bench-outcome-fields\">\r\n                <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"step_id\" value=\"evap-2\">\r\n                <select name=\"outcome\">\r\n                  <option value=\"ok\" >OK</option>\r\n                  <option value=\"fault_found\" >Fault found</option>\r\n                  <option value=\"skipped\" >Skipped</option>\r\n                </select>\r\n                <input type=\"text\" name=\"note\" placeholder=\"finding / reason\" value=\"\">\r\n                <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn\">Save</button>\r\n              </form>\r\n              \r\n            </div>\r\n          </details>\r\n          \r\n          \r\n          \r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    \r\n      <div class=\"bench-card\" id=\"task-evap-3\" data-task-id=\"evap-3\" data-state=\"ready\">\r\n        <form method=\"post\" action=\"/v/ZASFAKPN5J7B88115/bench/done\" class=\"bench-check\">\r\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"step_id\" value=\"evap-